<<<
agent, Alien, bona fide, cdmic, corroborate, décent, écho, éthics, et cétera, fastidious, idéa, jocésity (& all in -osity), military, minor, mitigate, odour, pathetic (& most in -etic), sénile, solitary, variety (& all in -iety).
===
ăgent, ălien, bŏnâ fīde, cōmic, corrōborate, dĕcent, ēcho, ēthics, et cētera, fastīdious, ĭdĕa, jocōsity (& all in -osity), mīlitary, mĭnor, mĭtigate, ŏdour, pathētic (& most in -etic), sĕnile, sōlitary, varĭety (& all in -iety).
