<<<
It is useless to call out ‘false quantity’ to someone who says ration or idyl or tribu’nal or aménity when he can answer you with agent, fastidious, minor, or écho.
===
It is useless to call out 'false quantity' to someone who says rātion or ĭdyl or trību'nal or amĕnity when he can answer you with ăgent, fastīdious, mĭnor, or ēcho.
>>>

