>>>

<<<
In many words, such as canine & saline, vertigo, the latinist’s first thoughts (kani’n, sali’n, verti’g6) do not need modification
===
In many words, such as *canine* & *saline*, *vertigo*, the latinist's first thoughts (kanī'n, salī'n, vertī'gō) do not need modification
